Here are the templates in English, tailored for both JIRA and email.

### 1. JIRA Comment

*Since you are already inside the ticket context, this can be direct and concise.*

> Hi David,
> Hope you are well.
> Regarding this work item for the Hometrack CSV ingestion, Imran Vali is ready to raise the CDF request to create the new data product tag value **"Hometrack"**.
> Could you please reply directly to this ticket to confirm your ownership/approval as the proposed owner/HOD for this tag so we can proceed?
> Many thanks,
> [Your Name]

---

### 2. Email Template

*A bit more structured, including a clear subject line and context.*

> **Subject:** Ownership Confirmation Required: Data Product Tag "Hometrack"
> Hi David,
> Hope you are well.
> I am writing regarding the ingestion of the 7 Hometrack CSV files into AWS for the Hybrid Mortgage model. Imran Vali is ready to raise the CDF request for the creation of the new data product tag value **"Hometrack"**.
> Before he can proceed, he needs confirmation/approval from you as the proposed owner/HOD for this tag.
> Could you please reply to this email or leave a quick comment on the JIRA ticket to confirm your ownership?
> Thank you very much for your help.
> Best regards,
> [Your Name]
